{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"メール返します宣言してからの\n誕生日ってずるいよね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっとずつ返してるよ！\nまだ返しきれてないよ！←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おつかなりそー(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きのう\nファンレいただきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/10/5494051/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今から読みます｀・ω・´"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして\nきのうは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"FNSうたの夏まつり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出させていただきました(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんとに\n夢見てるみたいだった(*_*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"知ってるアーティストさんだらけに\n知ってる曲だらけなのに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂が出させていただけるなんて\nほんとにありがたいです(;_;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こういう番組に出演させていただくと\n反省点だとか\nいろいろ考えさせられるのがデフォですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回はそれに加え、\nいろいろ学べた気がします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/10/5494051/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかった｀・ω・´"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっともっと\nみなさんに知ってもらえて\nみなさんの目をひかせられるようになりたいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/10/5494051/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「「答えちゃうお( °_ゝ°)ノ」」"},{"type"